{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56148","headline":"七真赞 七 · 杜光庭","name":"七真赞 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人行各有本，皆由宿世功。\n立德务及时，发愿莫不从。\n善恶俱待对，倚伏理难穷。\n贤士奉法言，道亦在兼忘。\n解是大智慧，上爲太极公。\n宝怪罪连玉舆，命驾御九龙。\n金华擎洞经，捧香悉仙童。\n啸歌彻玄都，鸣玉叩琼钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}